  notes:
  - TC, fix collider size issue
  - TC, adjust impact locations to hit accurately to ground below
  - 'TC, make the dimming of the Lighting controller adjust on upgrade so it''s dark
    until end of last bolt plus cushion. '
  - Spell tree skill point system and leveling of spells
  - MERGE, SPAWN POINTS in lvl1 on spellbook
  - MERGE add the player controller lines shown to jacob
  - MERGE I added a canmovewhilecast for player controller so that we can lock movement
    during certain spells
  - MERGE, add player spellbook reference for spell ui. remove listener for spell
    switched and spell casted. delete corresponding game events
  - 'MERGE, CastAnim make line 666 just say if isreadytocast. remove mana logic. '
  - MERGE, get lighting controller onto game manager
  - POSTMERGE, animation syncing/timing with af
  - POSTMERGE, Delete boss health and implement loot drops
  - POSTMERGE, Move lighting dimmer to player controller
  - 'POSTMERGE, Test upgrades to make sure they work with new cast animation times. '
